          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Potential regional price exposure\n\nThis is **independent of retirement** and the Lifecycle status filter: modern VMs can appear here even when they are not retiring. A resource can appear in both sections. The retirement summary tiles remain retirement-only.\n\n**Unverified pricing scope.** The source is a [public Microsoft Learn Q&A post reproducing a customer notification](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/answers/questions/6025662/is-there-any-official-announcement-for-azure-vm-in), not a formal public Microsoft announcement. It reports regional changes effective **1 February 2027**: North Europe 17%; France Central/South 11%; West Europe and Norway East/West 9%; Southeast Asia 8%. Confirm the authoritative Service Health advisory and agreement before customer communication or financial decisions.\n\nThe table includes VMs/scale sets in those seven regions, including **reported exclusions** for context. A reported exclusion applies only to this regional update, not every price change. Unknown series are not assumed exempt. Percentages describe the reported region adjustment, **not an applied per-resource increase or an invoice forecast**. This section does not inventory Storage accounts/meters and is separate from the legacy-series pricing signal elsewhere in the workbook."
            },
            "name": "regional-price-intro",
            "styleSettings": {
              "margin": "0",
              "padding": "0"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.compute/virtualmachines' or type =~ 'microsoft.compute/virtualmachinescalesets'\n| extend IsVmss = (type =~ 'microsoft.compute/virtualmachinescalesets')\n// A Flexible-orchestration scale set surfaces BOTH the scale set (carrying\n// sku.capacity) and every member VM as separate Resource Graph rows. Counting\n// both double-reports the fleet, so member VMs are dropped here and the scale\n// set alone represents them. Uniform scale sets do not expose member VMs at\n// all, so they are unaffected. Flexible is the current Azure default, so this\n// matters for most modern fleets.\n\n| where IsVmss or isempty(tostring(properties.virtualMachineScaleSet.id))\n| extend VmSize = iff(IsVmss, tostring(sku.name), tostring(properties.hardwareProfile.vmSize))\n| extend Instances = iff(IsVmss, toint(sku.capacity), 1)\n| extend OsType = iff(IsVmss, tostring(properties.virtualMachineProfile.storageProfile.osDisk.osType), tostring(properties.storageProfile.osDisk.osType))\n| extend OsDiskId = tolower(tostring(properties.storageProfile.osDisk.managedDisk.id))\n| extend AvSetId = tostring(properties.availabilitySet.id)\n| extend PowerState = tostring(split(tostring(properties.extended.instanceView.powerState.code), '/')[1])\n| extend Zone = tostring(zones[0])\n| extend ImageSku = iff(IsVmss, tostring(properties.virtualMachineProfile.storageProfile.imageReference.sku), tostring(properties.storageProfile.imageReference.sku))\n| extend ImageId = iff(IsVmss, tostring(coalesce(properties.virtualMachineProfile.storageProfile.imageReference.id, properties.virtualMachineProfile.storageProfile.imageReference.sharedGalleryImageId, properties.virtualMachineProfile.storageProfile.imageReference.communityGalleryImageId)), tostring(coalesce(properties.storageProfile.imageReference.id, properties.storageProfile.imageReference.sharedGalleryImageId, properties.storageProfile.imageReference.communityGalleryImageId)))\n| extend ImagePublisher = iff(IsVmss, tostring(properties.virtualMachineProfile.storageProfile.imageReference.publisher), tostring(properties.storageProfile.imageReference.publisher))\n| extend GuestOsName = tostring(properties.extended.instanceView.osName)\n| project ResourceId = id, Name = name, ResourceGroup = resourceGroup, SubscriptionId = subscriptionId,\n          Region = location, VmSize, Instances, OsType, OsDiskId, AvSetId, PowerState, Zone, ImageSku, ImageId, ImagePublisher, GuestOsName, IsVmss, Tags = tags\n| extend AnnouncedRegionalPercent = toint(parse_json('{\"francecentral\":11,\"francesouth\":11,\"northeurope\":17,\"norwayeast\":9,\"norwaywest\":9,\"southeastasia\":8,\"westeurope\":9}')[tolower(Region)])\n| where isnotnull(AnnouncedRegionalPercent)\n| extend Series = tostring(parse_json('{\"standard_a1_v2\":\"Av2\",\"standard_a2_v2\":\"Av2\",\"standard_a2m_v2\":\"Amv2\",\"standard_a4_v2\":\"Av2\",\"standard_a4m_v2\":\"Amv2\",\"standard_a8_v2\":\"Av2\",\"standard_a8m_v2\":\"Amv2\",\"standard_b12ms\":\"Bmsv1\",\"standard_b16as_v2\":\"Basv2\",\"standard_b16ms\":\"Bmsv1\",\"standard_b16s_v2\":\"Bsv2\",\"standard_b1ls\":\"Blsv1\",\"standard_b1ms\":\"Bmsv1\",\"standard_b1s\":\"Bsv1\",\"standard_b20ms\":\"Bmsv1\",\"standard_b2as_v2\":\"Basv2\",\"standard_b2ms\":\"Bmsv1\",\"standard_b2s\":\"Bsv1\",\"standard_b2s_v2\":\"Bsv2\",\"standard_b32as_v2\":\"Basv2\",\"standard_b32s_v2\":\"Bsv2\",\"standard_b4as_v2\":\"Basv2\",\"standard_b4ms\":\"Bmsv1\",\"standard_b4s_v2\":\"Bsv2\",\"standard_b8as_v2\":\"Basv2\",\"standard_b8ms\":\"Bmsv1\",\"standard_b8s_v2\":\"Bsv2\",\"standard_d1\":\"Dv1\",\"standard_d11\":\"Dv1\",\"standard_d11_v2\":\"Dv2\",\"standard_d11_v2_promo\":\"Dv2\",\"standard_d12\":\"Dv1\",\"standard_d12_v2\":\"Dv2\",\"standard_d12_v2_promo\":\"Dv2\",\"standard_d13\":\"Dv1\",\"standard_d13_v2\":\"Dv2\",\"standard_d13_v2_promo\":\"Dv2\",\"standard_d14\":\"Dv1\",\"standard_d14_v2\":\"Dv2\",\"standard_d14_v2_promo\":\"Dv2\",\"standard_d15_v2\":\"Dv2\",\"standard_d16_v3\":\"Dv3\"